  m_text: "                       [ Pay attention to the icons during an earthquake!
    ]\n\u2022 They Quake Indicator signals when the ground is shaking, reminding
    you to take cover immediately.\n\u2022 The Slow Status effect warns that your
    movement is limited, so stay calm and move carefully until the tremors pass.\n\u2022
    The Panic Meter shows your panic level\u2014avoid letting it fill up completely.
    Taking cover under an empty table or desk reduces your panic, while being exposed
    to falling objects increases it.\n\u2022 Lockers may fall on you if you are out
    during an earthquake.\n\u2022 Share your knowledge to stranded NPCs to help them."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
